.Dd November 10, 2026
.Dt DEBUG_WRITE 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm debug_write
.Nd write bytes to the debug console
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Ft int
.Fn debug_write "const void *ptr" "size_t len"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The .Nm system call writes .Fa len bytes from .Fa ptr to the kernel debug console.
.Pp
This page documents the native RavenBSD ABI; see the
.Pa raven-abi
crate for the exact numeric value and types.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
On success .Nm returns a non-negative value; on failure it returns a negative error number.
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
